WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.084 --> 01:44.040
=Episode 17=

02:16.820 --> 02:17.540
Gao Haiming.

02:19.939 --> 02:20.659
Gao Haiming.

02:22.300 --> 02:24.700
I just saw someone in your house.

02:25.860 --> 02:27.300
A dark figure passed by the window.

02:29.459 --> 02:30.100
Stay here.

02:30.260 --> 02:30.899
I'll go check.

02:31.179 --> 02:31.899
Let's go together.

02:31.899 --> 02:32.840
I'll get you clothes.

02:38.700 --> 02:39.219
It's okay.

02:57.580 --> 02:58.739
Is your house haunted?

03:06.420 --> 03:07.059
Ms. Fang?

03:08.339 --> 03:10.260
Mr. Gao, are you still awake?

03:35.779 --> 03:36.380
Ms. Fang.

03:37.540 --> 03:40.020
If you wanted to come back to get stuff,

03:40.580 --> 03:42.420
you could've come back openly.

03:43.179 --> 03:44.459
There's no need

03:44.700 --> 03:46.700
to sneak back
in the middle of the night.

03:48.540 --> 03:51.100
I was just worried
about disturbing you two...

03:54.179 --> 03:55.820
Disturbing Mr. Gao.

03:58.700 --> 03:59.300
Fine.

03:59.300 --> 04:00.779
Ms. Fang, since you're back,

04:01.100 --> 04:02.619
then stay and take care of him.

04:02.899 --> 04:04.219
Look how sick he is.

04:04.219 --> 04:05.420
I can't handle it alone.

04:11.260 --> 04:11.848
Well...

04:12.700 --> 04:13.619
I...

04:15.339 --> 04:15.939
I...

04:18.539 --> 04:19.260
I'm sorry.

04:19.500 --> 04:20.740
I have things to do at home.

04:20.740 --> 04:21.419
I'll go back.

04:21.740 --> 04:22.339
Ms. Fang.

04:22.539 --> 04:23.659
Mr. Lu can handle things

04:23.659 --> 04:24.659
for you at home.

04:24.659 --> 04:26.180
He is your husband.

04:26.180 --> 04:27.339
No need for you both to go.

04:27.339 --> 04:28.339
My husband?

04:28.500 --> 04:29.620
Since when did I...

04:35.060 --> 04:35.820
Right.

04:35.859 --> 04:37.979
Mr. Lu is my husband.

04:38.539 --> 04:39.500
But...

04:39.500 --> 04:40.299
Well...

04:40.419 --> 04:41.140
We need to handle

04:41.140 --> 04:42.260
things together.

04:42.419 --> 04:43.940
Mr. Lu is

04:43.940 --> 04:45.779
too careless

04:46.020 --> 04:46.779
to make it done.

04:46.779 --> 04:47.700
He would mess it up.

04:49.299 --> 04:51.419
Ms. Fang, you call your husband

04:51.659 --> 04:52.899
Mr. Lu?

04:54.700 --> 04:55.779
Mr. Lu...

04:57.620 --> 05:00.459
That's a very distant way
to address your husband.

05:00.859 --> 05:02.500
Mr. Gao, Miss Lin.

05:03.060 --> 05:04.620
I'll go back to take care of Mr. Lu...

05:04.979 --> 05:05.580
My husband.

05:05.580 --> 05:06.779
I'm leaving now. Bye!

05:14.899 --> 05:15.779
Gao Haiming.

05:16.500 --> 05:18.419
Can you stop lying?

05:21.060 --> 05:22.700
I-I'm feeling sick.

05:22.820 --> 05:23.580
Feeling sick?

05:23.580 --> 05:25.500
Fine. Then Feel it by yourself.

05:25.500 --> 05:26.180
I'm going back.

05:26.820 --> 05:27.740
No, don't.

05:29.299 --> 05:31.659
Still faking it?
Are you addicted to that?

05:32.060 --> 05:34.020
I just feel a bit dizzy.

05:34.820 --> 05:35.899
I really don't know

05:35.899 --> 05:36.820
if you're telling truth

05:36.820 --> 05:37.779
or lies.

05:38.539 --> 05:39.580
This time it's true.

05:47.500 --> 05:48.060
What's wrong?

05:48.060 --> 05:49.260
Why did your fever come again?

05:49.740 --> 05:51.219
I'll get you back to your room.

06:11.299 --> 06:12.580
Your fever is still running,

06:16.740 --> 06:17.419
Gao Haiming.

06:20.140 --> 06:20.820
Gao Haiming.

07:37.779 --> 07:38.459
Miss Lin.

07:39.700 --> 07:41.140
You and Mr. Gao are up?

07:42.060 --> 07:43.339
Breakfast is ready.

07:43.459 --> 07:44.008
Okay.

07:44.859 --> 07:45.419
Thank you.

08:29.260 --> 08:30.500
System has detected the Player

08:30.500 --> 08:31.859
has been slacking off recently.

08:32.100 --> 08:33.539
A timed quest will be assigned.

08:33.539 --> 08:34.059
Wait.

08:34.220 --> 08:35.819
Player, you must rip off

08:35.819 --> 08:37.260
Male Lead's clothes within 24 hours.

08:37.299 --> 08:39.220
What? Did I hear that right?

08:39.939 --> 08:40.860
Tear off his clothes?

08:41.419 --> 08:43.179
Quests are getting more
and more outrageous!

08:43.380 --> 08:44.539
Tearing off his clothes

08:44.539 --> 08:45.299
while he's sleeping

08:45.299 --> 08:46.699
is extremely rude behavior.

08:46.899 --> 08:47.779
Change it for me.

08:48.699 --> 08:49.939
Countdown begins now.

08:56.779 --> 08:58.500
Do I have to stay here tonight?

09:02.059 --> 09:03.579
How am I supposed to do it?

09:34.620 --> 09:35.620
What are you doing?

09:39.460 --> 09:40.100
Good morning.

09:41.620 --> 09:42.659
I brought you breakfast.

09:43.059 --> 09:43.848
Remember to have it

09:45.260 --> 09:46.100
and take medicine.

09:57.179 --> 09:57.980
Have some water.

09:59.059 --> 09:59.624
Okay.

10:05.699 --> 10:06.260
Are you okay?

10:07.020 --> 10:07.740
My hand slipped.

10:08.899 --> 10:09.819
You're pretty agile.

10:19.500 --> 10:21.260
I just saw a loose thread
on your clothes.

10:21.576 --> 10:22.179
I'll cut it.

10:22.179 --> 10:23.112
What have I done?

10:23.112 --> 10:23.620
Don't move.

10:23.620 --> 10:24.419
No, no need.

10:24.419 --> 10:25.460
Stop it. What do you want?

10:25.460 --> 10:26.779
I'll just cut the loose thread.

10:26.779 --> 10:28.299
No need, thanks.

10:30.340 --> 10:30.939
Thanks.

10:35.419 --> 10:37.939
I didn't want it to ruin your look.

10:42.059 --> 10:43.539
No need. I don't need anything.

10:43.539 --> 10:44.140
I'm fine.

10:44.220 --> 10:45.220
Time to get changed.

10:46.179 --> 10:46.939
No need.

10:46.984 --> 10:47.699
No need.

10:47.699 --> 10:48.220
Let me help.

10:48.220 --> 10:48.740
No need.

10:48.740 --> 10:49.860
- It's fine. I should help.
- Wait.

10:49.860 --> 10:50.659
No need.

10:52.819 --> 10:53.419
Lin Huan'er.

10:54.460 --> 10:55.100
Lin Huan'er.

11:02.299 --> 11:02.899
I...

11:03.939 --> 11:04.620
I'll go shower.

11:04.819 --> 11:05.500
No need.

11:05.500 --> 11:06.620
I-I'll go right now.

11:13.740 --> 11:14.980
This is so difficult for me.

11:47.020 --> 11:48.860
I need to tear off his clothes.

11:49.980 --> 11:51.299
But it didn't specify

11:51.299 --> 11:53.340
tearing the clothes he's wearing.

11:55.419 --> 11:56.140
I'm such

11:56.699 --> 11:57.460
a genius.

12:02.220 --> 12:02.860
Sorry.

12:15.299 --> 12:16.500
What do you want?

12:17.059 --> 12:17.736
I...

12:18.899 --> 12:19.419
Listen,

12:19.419 --> 12:20.299
this shirt is torn

12:20.299 --> 12:22.380
and I want to sew it for you.

12:25.819 --> 12:26.980
Did the shirt offend you

12:26.980 --> 12:28.100
or me?

12:28.500 --> 12:29.340
Neither.

12:30.340 --> 12:31.980
I might have used too much strength

12:31.980 --> 12:33.899
and accidentally tore it.

12:33.899 --> 12:34.980
I'll buy you a new one.

12:35.500 --> 12:36.100
Forget it.

12:37.140 --> 12:38.579
I don't know what's wrong with you,

12:38.779 --> 12:39.419
but

12:40.220 --> 12:41.419
it must be the shirt's fault.

12:46.419 --> 12:46.939
Huan'er...

12:46.939 --> 12:47.939
Go rest now.

12:50.860 --> 12:51.899
I'll sew it properly.

12:52.340 --> 12:53.140
Go rest now.

12:57.299 --> 12:57.860
Fine.

13:02.980 --> 13:04.380
He must think I'm crazy.

13:07.699 --> 13:08.939
But anyway,

13:10.020 --> 13:11.899
I finally finished this timed quest

13:11.899 --> 13:12.579
well.

13:15.860 --> 13:16.699
Dear Player,

13:16.699 --> 13:17.860
for your timed quest,

13:17.860 --> 13:19.500
you only have 2:17:35 left.

13:19.500 --> 13:20.740
Please hurry up.

13:21.220 --> 13:23.020
I tore it. I did!

13:23.980 --> 13:24.819
Warning,

13:24.939 --> 13:25.699
do not attempt

13:25.699 --> 13:27.340
to exploit system loopholes anymore.

13:27.419 --> 13:29.160
Otherwise, it'll cause
severe consequences.

13:29.899 --> 13:31.260
Tell me what serious consequences.

13:31.260 --> 13:32.500
What consequences? Tell me.

13:33.500 --> 13:36.179
Male Lead will run a fever
for three days because of you.

13:38.819 --> 13:39.460
Wait.

13:40.659 --> 13:42.100
What kind of lousy system is this?

13:42.740 --> 13:43.860
I didn't finish this quest,

13:43.860 --> 13:45.260
so you punish him?

13:45.779 --> 13:46.899
You're unreasonable.

13:51.980 --> 13:53.020
So I tore it for nothing?

13:56.939 --> 13:57.819
(Gao Haiming.)

13:58.500 --> 13:59.699
(Don't blame me.)

14:00.579 --> 14:01.659
(I'm doing so to help you)

14:01.659 --> 14:02.860
(get better soon.)

14:18.268 --> 14:21.960
♪Old photos, yellowed♪

14:22.184 --> 14:26.120
♪Timelines, tangled♪

14:26.984 --> 14:30.632
♪I boarded a rickety time machine♪

14:30.696 --> 14:33.800
♪Heart pounding, won't stop♪

14:33.928 --> 14:37.640
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

14:38.056 --> 14:42.088
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

14:42.760 --> 14:46.280
♪Your smile is like stars that shimmer♪

14:46.696 --> 14:52.072
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪

14:53.320 --> 15:00.584
♪Love's time machine,
flies, flies, flies♪

15:01.000 --> 15:08.520
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

15:09.064 --> 15:16.552
♪Love's time machine keeps on turning♪

15:16.904 --> 15:21.384
♪Streaking across the sky♪

15:22.120 --> 15:29.832
♪Just to hold you♪

15:40.891 --> 15:44.744
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

15:44.840 --> 15:49.000
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

15:49.672 --> 15:53.288
♪Your smile is like stars that shimmer♪

15:53.640 --> 15:58.792
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪

16:00.200 --> 16:07.784
♪Love's time machine,
flies, flies, flies♪

16:07.880 --> 16:15.368
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

16:15.912 --> 16:19.720
♪Love's time machine♪

16:39.539 --> 16:40.100
Hello.

16:40.659 --> 16:42.179
Mr. Gao, how are you?

16:42.220 --> 16:43.220
Should I pick you up?

16:43.939 --> 16:45.340
It's fine. I can go myself.

16:45.659 --> 16:46.299
Don't.

16:46.299 --> 16:47.059
You just recovered.

16:47.059 --> 16:48.100
How can I let you drive?

16:48.140 --> 16:49.020
I'm already on my way.

16:49.340 --> 16:50.620
I said no.

16:50.620 --> 16:51.500
I'll go by myself.

16:51.939 --> 16:53.299
Are you really okay?

16:54.059 --> 16:55.659
Can't talk now?

16:55.860 --> 16:56.539
Maybe I...

16:56.579 --> 16:59.260
Luo, why are you still at the office?

16:59.579 --> 17:01.059
Okay. Don't worry.

17:01.059 --> 17:02.419
I'll hang up right now.

17:24.900 --> 17:25.460
Huan'er.

17:57.980 --> 17:59.819
I'm waiting for Hu Tiehan at school.

18:00.420 --> 18:01.660
In these two days,

18:01.900 --> 18:02.660
have you

18:02.660 --> 18:04.180
been staying at Gao Haiming's place?

18:04.339 --> 18:05.180
I'll get to work.

18:05.180 --> 18:06.099
Talk later.

18:06.339 --> 18:07.099
Don't hang up.

18:07.299 --> 18:09.020
Tell me more.

18:09.420 --> 18:10.900
I heard his parents

18:10.900 --> 18:12.220
went to Sweden, right?

18:12.379 --> 18:13.220
So in these two days,

18:13.220 --> 18:14.619
you two have been living

18:14.619 --> 18:15.660
under the same roof.

18:16.579 --> 18:17.859
What stage have you reached?

18:18.059 --> 18:19.619
Last night, did you...

18:19.619 --> 18:21.660
Stop! Don't imagine things.

18:21.660 --> 18:22.819
I'm going to work now. Bye.

18:23.299 --> 18:23.819
Hello.

18:27.020 --> 18:28.220
She's being shy.

18:36.500 --> 18:37.339
Congratulations.

18:37.660 --> 18:38.539
Male Lead's fondness

18:38.539 --> 18:40.059
has reached 84 percent.

18:44.059 --> 18:47.660
It was 83 percent
after tearing off his clothes yesterday.

18:48.460 --> 18:49.619
It became 84 percent now?

18:49.619 --> 18:51.099
Why did this happen?

18:57.859 --> 18:58.379
You...

18:59.059 --> 19:00.779
You startled me.

19:01.339 --> 19:02.539
You left without telling me.

19:04.980 --> 19:06.819
I-I need to go back and change clothes.

19:13.379 --> 19:14.980
Fine, let's go up together then.

19:15.379 --> 19:15.940
No.

19:17.579 --> 19:19.299
I've been exercising lately,

19:19.420 --> 19:20.460
so I'll take the stairs.

19:20.740 --> 19:21.619
You take the elevator.

19:27.819 --> 19:29.500
Why is the school so empty today?

19:30.740 --> 19:32.460
Did you forget
it's the spring outing day?

19:34.299 --> 19:35.139
Right.

19:35.379 --> 19:36.379
You still remember that?

19:36.379 --> 19:37.260
I forgot it.

19:38.700 --> 19:39.500
Why are we here?

19:40.059 --> 19:40.779
Practice singing.

19:42.260 --> 19:43.059
In here?

19:43.260 --> 19:43.859
Yes.

19:44.619 --> 19:45.619
Maybe not.

19:47.139 --> 19:47.940
What's wrong?

19:48.220 --> 19:49.460
Just imagine this

19:49.460 --> 19:51.260
is the competition venue.

19:51.619 --> 19:52.420
No way!

19:52.859 --> 19:53.819
In the competition,

19:53.819 --> 19:55.299
there'll be lots of audiences,

19:55.660 --> 19:56.940
and I'll get stage fright.

19:57.579 --> 19:58.579
Let's practice it now.

20:00.220 --> 20:00.779
Come on.

20:02.299 --> 20:02.984
Well...

20:06.020 --> 20:06.660
Come on.

20:11.619 --> 20:12.579
Alright.

20:34.440 --> 20:36.008
(The breeze on the Champs-Elysees)

20:40.059 --> 20:42.180
(The breeze on the Champs-Elysees?)

20:43.819 --> 20:44.779
(It's quite romantic.)

20:47.080 --> 20:48.104
(The breeze on the Champs-Elysees?)

20:48.168 --> 20:49.384
(Dinner together?)

21:42.379 --> 21:43.260
Drink anything?

21:43.260 --> 21:44.059
I'll pour you water.

21:44.059 --> 21:44.740
I'll have tea.

21:45.260 --> 21:46.260
Tea? I'll get it for you.

21:46.260 --> 21:46.779
I'll do it.

21:49.299 --> 21:50.059
I'll pour water.

21:50.059 --> 21:50.779
I'll do it.

22:05.180 --> 22:06.139
What are you afraid of?

22:06.819 --> 22:08.740
What? I...

22:09.299 --> 22:10.420
I'm not afraid of anything.

22:17.192 --> 22:18.632
How much longer do I have to wait?

22:21.779 --> 22:23.619
The meeting minutes from this morning?

22:23.619 --> 22:24.779
This afternoon.

22:34.539 --> 22:35.139
Lin Huan'er.

22:35.940 --> 22:37.059
I'm waiting for your answer.

22:38.859 --> 22:39.379
Wait.

22:39.420 --> 22:40.500
We're in the office.

22:40.500 --> 22:41.299
What do you want?

22:46.059 --> 22:47.740
If not in the office,

22:50.220 --> 22:51.020
then in private?

22:51.208 --> 22:54.191
♪Entwined worries linger♪

22:55.400 --> 22:58.171
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

23:00.072 --> 23:05.985
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

23:07.782 --> 23:10.842
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

23:12.008 --> 23:15.460
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

23:18.260 --> 23:20.020
They definitely saw us.

23:37.779 --> 23:38.312
Mr. Gao.

23:39.139 --> 23:40.059
Pour water yourself?

23:40.059 --> 23:41.339
Should've let me do it for you.

23:48.539 --> 23:49.220
Mr. Gao.

23:49.859 --> 23:51.700
How have you been
at home these two days?

23:57.539 --> 23:58.379
What do you mean?

23:58.504 --> 23:59.880
What would you like for dinner?

24:00.020 --> 24:00.819
I'll go arrange it.

24:02.819 --> 24:03.379
Whatever.

24:04.859 --> 24:05.500
Whatever?

24:25.460 --> 24:26.059
Mengmeng.

24:26.779 --> 24:27.420
Have warm water.

24:28.220 --> 24:29.260
Hold it to warm up.

24:30.940 --> 24:32.139
I'm sorry. I...

24:32.539 --> 24:33.260
I didn't expect

24:33.260 --> 24:34.700
the weather to be so cold today,

24:34.980 --> 24:35.859
making you get a cold.

24:36.740 --> 24:37.379
Silly me.

24:37.379 --> 24:38.299
It's fine.

24:38.619 --> 24:40.619
Maybe I just didn't wear enough today.

24:41.379 --> 24:42.740
Don't you have duty soon?

24:42.740 --> 24:43.260
Go now.

24:43.260 --> 24:44.020
I took leave.

24:44.579 --> 24:45.700
I want to take care of you.

24:46.940 --> 24:47.619
No need.

24:49.660 --> 24:50.740
Are you hungry?

24:50.859 --> 24:51.980
Maybe I make you some food.

24:52.619 --> 24:53.619
Really, no need.

24:54.220 --> 24:56.180
Right, you have no appetite.

24:56.859 --> 24:58.099
I'll cook you some congee.

25:18.660 --> 25:19.420
Why are you here?

25:20.940 --> 25:22.220
You cook often?

25:22.420 --> 25:24.299
You seem really skilled at it.

25:26.020 --> 25:27.099
Well, I live alone,

25:27.660 --> 25:29.740
so I cook sometimes.

25:33.020 --> 25:34.779
This feeling is so surreal.

25:35.460 --> 25:37.619
I've seen you in school uniform.

25:37.740 --> 25:39.460
I've seen you in work uniform.

25:40.460 --> 25:42.180
But this is the first time
seeing you cook.

25:43.260 --> 25:44.220
Feeling unfamiliar?

25:44.859 --> 25:45.460
Not at all.

25:46.139 --> 25:46.819
That's good.

25:49.460 --> 25:51.180
Returning to school today

25:51.900 --> 25:52.940
reminds me

25:53.139 --> 25:54.420
of many childhood memories.

25:55.059 --> 25:56.059
Do you remember?

25:56.339 --> 25:57.539
The cafeteria once

25:57.539 --> 25:58.980
sold the super spicy burger,

25:58.980 --> 26:00.059
and you had to try it.

26:00.339 --> 26:01.339
But after one bite,

26:01.339 --> 26:03.779
your face turned as red as a lobster.

26:04.139 --> 26:05.700
You even chugged two glasses of water.

26:05.700 --> 26:06.619
Of course, I remember.

26:07.379 --> 26:08.139
That burger

26:08.139 --> 26:09.339
was ridiculously spicy.

26:09.460 --> 26:10.339
I wondered

26:10.339 --> 26:11.619
if the chef put a whole bottle

26:11.619 --> 26:12.660
of chili sauce in it.

26:14.220 --> 26:16.299
And, during sports day,

26:16.660 --> 26:18.280
you and Huan'er were running the relay.

26:18.819 --> 26:20.260
You got nervous and threw

26:20.260 --> 26:21.220
the baton straight out.

26:21.379 --> 26:23.020
Everyone was stunned.

26:23.740 --> 26:25.020
Our class's championship

26:25.020 --> 26:26.660
was gone with that one throw.

26:28.260 --> 26:29.260
Fine.

26:29.859 --> 26:31.220
You only remember

26:31.220 --> 26:32.260
my embarrassing stories.

26:33.020 --> 26:33.819
Actually, Mengmeng.

26:34.819 --> 26:36.260
Today at the school,

26:36.260 --> 26:38.579
when I saw you sing on the stairs

26:40.220 --> 26:41.220
with confidence,

26:41.740 --> 26:42.740
shining bright,

26:44.099 --> 26:44.940
it felt

26:45.420 --> 26:46.900
like we were back in school.

26:50.339 --> 26:51.020
So,

26:53.299 --> 26:54.779
you must attend the competition.

26:55.660 --> 26:57.059
You'll definitely shine bright

26:57.859 --> 26:59.299
and win Best Vocal Performance.

27:01.940 --> 27:04.859
Right now, I just hope to win

27:05.260 --> 27:06.539
Best Patient Award.

27:10.379 --> 27:12.220
Alright, go rest then.

27:12.900 --> 27:13.940
I'll bring you

27:13.940 --> 27:14.660
the congee over.

27:26.980 --> 27:28.059
Luo, we're leaving.

27:28.139 --> 27:28.680
Bye.

27:29.020 --> 27:30.020
Huan'er, let's go.

27:30.099 --> 27:30.940
- You go ahead.
- You go ahead.

27:31.260 --> 27:32.260
I need to talk to Lin.

27:32.940 --> 27:33.480
Okay.

27:38.420 --> 27:39.020
What's wrong?

27:39.180 --> 27:40.139
Any more work stuff

27:40.139 --> 27:40.859
to talk to me?

27:43.099 --> 27:44.500
Just go. It's all arranged.

27:45.020 --> 27:45.700
Where to?

27:46.379 --> 27:47.099
Relax.

27:47.180 --> 27:48.700
The restaurant is super discreet.

27:49.020 --> 27:49.779
I booked it myself.

27:50.220 --> 27:51.180
No employees

27:51.180 --> 27:52.020
would find out.

27:52.900 --> 27:55.299
And I'll have Mr. Gao arrive later.

27:55.779 --> 27:56.940
Just relax and enjoy

27:56.940 --> 27:58.180
your candlelit dinner.

27:58.180 --> 28:00.379
Wait, no!

28:01.260 --> 28:02.539
Let him eat alone.

28:02.619 --> 28:04.059
I have a lot to do.

28:04.059 --> 28:04.819
And I won't go.

28:05.180 --> 28:05.819
Lin,

28:06.420 --> 28:08.139
how could you be so ungrateful?

28:09.099 --> 28:10.819
What's wrong with you?

28:11.059 --> 28:12.180
Why don't you cherish

28:12.180 --> 28:13.299
such a golden opportunity?

28:14.059 --> 28:15.339
What's wrong with Mr. Gao?

28:15.740 --> 28:16.940
You cherish it, you go then.

28:17.740 --> 28:18.579
Honestly,

28:19.139 --> 28:20.900
having worked
for Mr. Gao for so many years,

28:21.539 --> 28:22.980
I've never seen him care so much

28:22.980 --> 28:23.980
about anyone before.

28:24.460 --> 28:25.700
He definitely likes you.

28:28.660 --> 28:29.500
Touching, right?

28:31.740 --> 28:33.220
You've worked for him for many years.

28:34.539 --> 28:36.180
And you are his right-hand person.

28:37.059 --> 28:37.859
Then you must know

28:37.859 --> 28:39.260
all his preferences, right?

28:42.059 --> 28:43.099
What do you want to know?

28:43.460 --> 28:44.260
Tell me,

28:44.539 --> 28:45.660
I'll give you the answer.

28:47.020 --> 28:47.940
Then tell me,

28:48.740 --> 28:49.859
what should I do

28:50.299 --> 28:52.220
to make him stop liking me so much?

29:08.360 --> 29:09.416
(Letao Tower)

29:39.048 --> 29:39.752
(Letao Forum)

29:39.816 --> 29:40.648
(Pinned: Surprised!
Has Mr. Gao Been Captured by "Her"?)

29:40.648 --> 29:41.352
(Pinned: Read now!
Boss Lady Emerges from the Break Room)

29:48.420 --> 29:50.420
(You guys spread rumors pretty fast.)

29:50.700 --> 29:52.619
(It really feels like
the internet age now.)

30:04.539 --> 30:05.128
Huan'er.

30:05.700 --> 30:07.859
What's going on between you and Mr. Gao?

30:08.299 --> 30:09.260
Tell us.

30:10.299 --> 30:12.260
There's really nothing.

30:14.059 --> 30:15.859
Huan'er, we're caring about you.

30:16.420 --> 30:17.020
Exactly.

30:17.379 --> 30:18.940
The domineering CEO and Cinderella

30:19.059 --> 30:20.059
are only in a fairy tale.

30:20.420 --> 30:21.619
In real life,

30:21.619 --> 30:23.020
how could they end up happiness?

30:25.940 --> 30:27.900
We're both unmarried.

30:28.139 --> 30:29.299
Even if we date,

30:29.299 --> 30:30.579
what's wrong with that?

30:31.099 --> 30:33.059
Just because I'm an ordinary employee

30:33.059 --> 30:34.220
and he's a domineering CEO,

30:34.339 --> 30:36.180
then you think I'm daydreaming?

30:36.539 --> 30:38.379
Just imagine, if I were

30:38.819 --> 30:39.779
a domineering CEO

30:40.020 --> 30:41.180
and he's my secretary,

30:41.500 --> 30:42.180
would you think

30:42.180 --> 30:43.139
that makes more sense?

30:50.180 --> 30:50.900
Congratulations.

30:51.180 --> 30:52.460
Male Lead's fondness toward you

30:52.460 --> 30:54.180
has reached 86 percent.

30:54.180 --> 30:56.180
Your quest is almost complete! Congrats!

30:59.379 --> 31:00.020
Well...

31:00.779 --> 31:01.460
No, I...

31:01.740 --> 31:02.660
I didn't mean I wanted

31:02.660 --> 31:03.980
you to be my secretary.

31:04.339 --> 31:05.139
I just...

31:09.740 --> 31:10.539
I'll get back.

31:16.940 --> 31:17.779
Finished your tasks?

31:18.859 --> 31:19.660
- We leave now.
- We're leaving.

31:28.059 --> 31:29.059
Hello. Who's this?

31:29.980 --> 31:30.579
Miss Lin,

31:30.579 --> 31:32.379
you're quite forgetful.

31:32.500 --> 31:34.260
Can't even recognize my voice?

31:34.260 --> 31:35.819
I'm Gao Haiming's father.

31:36.779 --> 31:37.900
Chairman Gao,

31:38.539 --> 31:39.819
what can I do for you?

31:40.420 --> 31:42.220
You must feel pretty pleased
with yourself.

31:42.220 --> 31:42.940
Miss Lin.

31:43.260 --> 31:44.220
I heard

31:44.220 --> 31:46.500
rumors spreading
in the company intranet.

31:47.099 --> 31:47.940
It seems

31:47.940 --> 31:49.420
you've fully taken advantage

31:49.420 --> 31:51.700
of our time in Sweden.

31:52.139 --> 31:54.139
You've misunderstood me.

31:54.619 --> 31:56.700
Misunderstood? How?

31:57.139 --> 31:58.980
Are you trying to say

31:58.980 --> 32:00.379
you truly love Haiming,

32:00.420 --> 32:02.260
and not for his money?

32:04.099 --> 32:05.500
Surprised, are you?

32:05.859 --> 32:06.819
Did I beat you

32:06.819 --> 32:08.859
to saying your lines?

32:09.260 --> 32:10.379
But it doesn't matter.

32:11.220 --> 32:12.500
Because I won't believe

32:12.500 --> 32:13.740
whatever you say now.

32:14.339 --> 32:15.460
Why couldn't I

32:15.460 --> 32:16.539
truly love him?

32:16.819 --> 32:18.740
If you truly loved Haiming,

32:18.740 --> 32:20.579
Letao's new product sales figures

32:20.579 --> 32:21.940
wouldn't be this dismal.

32:22.099 --> 32:23.339
A good woman

32:23.339 --> 32:25.660
supports and uplifts her man.

32:26.139 --> 32:27.660
But a woman like you

32:27.859 --> 32:28.779
is just dead weight

32:28.779 --> 32:30.339
to him.

32:30.539 --> 32:31.059
Understand?

32:31.700 --> 32:33.740
Capturing market share with new products

32:33.740 --> 32:35.660
takes time.

32:37.059 --> 32:37.740
Besides, if I

32:37.740 --> 32:39.339
can't boost Letao's sales figures,

32:39.339 --> 32:40.940
it means I don't deserve to love him?

32:41.220 --> 32:42.220
This is ridiculous.

32:43.059 --> 32:44.059
Miss Lin.

32:45.059 --> 32:47.139
I'm calling you now

32:47.339 --> 32:48.940
to give you a chance

32:49.139 --> 32:51.980
to prove your true love.

32:52.980 --> 32:55.339
Given the current sales figures,

32:55.539 --> 32:56.900
even if I take the production line

32:56.900 --> 32:58.420
away from Haiming,

32:58.779 --> 33:00.980
I doubt the board would object.

33:01.619 --> 33:03.139
When I return,

33:03.379 --> 33:04.579
I'll find

33:04.579 --> 33:07.099
a suitable marriage partner for Haiming.

33:08.700 --> 33:10.379
As for your fate,

33:11.220 --> 33:12.139
that depends on

33:12.339 --> 33:14.460
whether you truly love Haiming.

33:18.139 --> 33:19.139
How rude!

33:37.256 --> 33:37.832
(Trend Analysis Chart)

33:37.896 --> 33:39.688
(Current Situation Analysis
Product Features, Channel Strategy, Consumer Awareness)

33:43.859 --> 33:44.460
(Wait.)

33:44.700 --> 33:45.579
(I'm not here)

33:45.579 --> 33:46.740
(to finish the sales quota.)

33:47.779 --> 33:49.220
(Even if he gets dismissed,)

33:49.220 --> 33:50.220
(he might be upset)

33:50.779 --> 33:52.299
(and making his fondness rise slower.)

33:53.900 --> 33:54.900
(But,)

33:55.740 --> 33:57.099
(how can I boost)

33:57.099 --> 33:58.379
(sales figures?)

34:01.579 --> 34:02.980
Huan'er, we're leaving.

34:03.379 --> 34:04.220
- Bye.
- Bye.

34:09.659 --> 34:10.300
Oh my!

34:10.500 --> 34:11.139
Luo.

34:11.139 --> 34:12.659
How did you get this magazine?

34:12.659 --> 34:13.539
Come on, show us.

34:14.259 --> 34:16.179
I checked several newsstands

34:16.820 --> 34:18.020
and snatched it

34:18.020 --> 34:19.659
from a bunch of girls and elder women.

34:20.340 --> 34:21.780
The last copy. Amazing, right?

34:22.460 --> 34:23.380
Go buy one too.

34:23.380 --> 34:24.500
Hurry.

34:26.619 --> 34:27.259
Luo.

34:28.179 --> 34:28.776
Luo.

34:32.539 --> 34:33.300
Let me see.

34:39.272 --> 34:40.360
(Gao Haiming)

34:40.360 --> 34:41.448
(Reconstructing Letao,
Advancing with the Times)

34:44.200 --> 34:45.000
(Gao Haiming)

34:45.000 --> 34:47.528
(Reconstructing Letao,
Advancing with the Times)

34:48.020 --> 34:48.900
Listen,

34:48.900 --> 34:50.020
they were all sold out

34:50.020 --> 34:51.432
at all the newsstands around here.

34:51.539 --> 34:52.659
This is the restocked one.

34:53.659 --> 34:54.219
Amazing, huh?

34:55.820 --> 34:56.380
Yes.

34:57.300 --> 34:58.059
So amazing!

35:00.259 --> 35:00.900
Lend it to me.

35:02.216 --> 35:02.860
What?

35:02.860 --> 35:03.780
I'm off work, bye.

35:05.500 --> 35:06.699
Give me back the magazine.

35:10.632 --> 35:13.615
♪Entwined worries linger♪

35:14.824 --> 35:17.595
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

35:19.496 --> 35:25.409
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

35:27.206 --> 35:30.266
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

35:31.432 --> 35:34.884
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

35:35.880 --> 35:41.406
♪Until the world's end♪

35:43.816 --> 35:47.612
♪If I could♪

35:48.200 --> 35:51.016
♪Keep loving you♪

35:52.040 --> 35:54.440
♪Hearing two hearts♪

35:54.440 --> 35:59.356
♪Beating together♪

36:00.328 --> 36:04.192
♪If I could♪

36:04.192 --> 36:07.432
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

36:08.488 --> 36:15.813
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

